1. Restart your shell session:
   - Type 'exit' then reconnect to your terminal
   (Recommended for locale and shell changes)

2. Verify installation:
   ./bin/verify --tier work --tail

3. Authenticate and smoke-test local sandboxes manually:
   sbx login
   ./bin/verify --tier work --smoke

4. Enroll Tailscale with your intended routing/SSH policy:
   sudo tailscale up

5. Switch theme (default: gruvbox):
   ./bin/theme-switcher

